{
  "_note": "活跃热力图取数。网格的 col/row/level 已由服务端逐格算好(merged.grid)——VParser 没有 floor，让渲染层去算 i/7 算不准；这也是「派生序列优先在数据层预计算」的直接应用。网格右下角 = 看的人这台设备的「今天」(?today=,2026-09-24 起);不带参数的老版本退回「数据里的最后一天」。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayQ",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "「今天」以看的人这台设备的日期为锚(2026-09-24)。不带它服务端只能拿「数据里最后一天」当今天 —— 今天还没用 Claude Code 时,「今日」会显示上一个活跃日的数。服务端只认离它自己 3 天以内的日期,算不出来就退回老行为,不会取不到数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "resp",
      "action": "request",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://usage.numable.app/s?today=${todayQ}&lite=1",
        "method": "GET",
        "header": {
          "User-Agent": "Numable"
        },
        "formatType": "json",
        "credential": "nu"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "grid",
        "value": "${resp.merged.grid}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gn",
        "value": "$[length::(${grid})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${resp},),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "ccusage_unreachable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "令牌被拒(服务端返错误体)是**明确答案** —— 不抛,卡上渲「未接入」引导重新填令牌。\n只有**完全没拿到响应**(网络失败)才抛。\n取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "live",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${gn},0),1),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "MONE",
        "value": [
          "Jan",
          "Feb",
          "Mar",
          "Apr",
          "May",
          "Jun",
          "Jul",
          "Aug",
          "Sep",
          "Oct",
          "Nov",
          "Dec"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "热力图起止月日:中文「7月26日」/ 英文「Jul 26」(doc/overseas-first.md §5,不出现纯数字日期)。拼接先落 Z / E 两个键再在 if 里引用。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLblIso",
        "value": "${resp.merged.gridStart}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLblMo",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(subString::(${startLblIso},5,7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLblDy",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(subString::(${startLblIso},8,10),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLblMe",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${startLblMo}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLblZ",
        "value": "${startLblMo}月${startLblDy}日"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLblE",
        "value": "${startLblMe} ${startLblDy}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "startLbl",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${startLblIso}),10),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${startLblZ},${startLblE}),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLblIso",
        "value": "${resp.merged.gridEnd}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLblMo",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(subString::(${endLblIso},5,7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLblDy",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(subString::(${endLblIso},8,10),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLblMe",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${endLblMo}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLblZ",
        "value": "${endLblMo}月${endLblDy}日"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLblE",
        "value": "${endLblMe} ${endLblDy}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endLbl",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${endLblIso}),10),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${endLblZ},${endLblE}),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "daysRaw",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${live},1),${resp.merged.totals.activeDays},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "streak",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${live},1),${resp.merged.totals.streak},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "longest",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${live},1),${resp.merged.totals.longestStreak},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "时效锚(card-design-system §3)= 采集侧最后一次上传的时刻(内容时间):当天 HH:mm、跨天 MM-dd HH:mm。外层判空哨兵勿删 —— formatDate::(空,…) 在 web SDK 上渲成 epoch。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.updatedAt},__none__),__none__),,if::(eq::(formatDate::(${resp.updatedAt},yyyyMMdd),formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyyMMdd)),formatDate::(${resp.updatedAt},HH:mm),formatDate::(${resp.updatedAt},MM-dd HH:mm)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "actN",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${live},1),length::(replaceAll::(join::(pluck::(${grid},l),~),[^1-4],)),)]"
      },
      "_note": "格子窗口内的活跃天数(2026-10-08):副标题原来写 totals.activeDays(全部历史),比格子还多。这里数窗口内 l≥1 的格:把每格档位拼成串、删掉 1–4 以外的字符,剩下的长度就是活跃天数(VParser 无 filter/count,见 vparser-regex-split-and-counting)。零新增请求。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[0].d},)]"
      },
      "_note": "月份刻度:格子按列 = 一周(c 列、r 行,首格 gridStart)。每列取首格日期,这一列里有某月 1 号(日 ≤ 7)就标月份;第 0 列恒标。缺格(数据不足 10 周)落空不标。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd0}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd0},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd0}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd0},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me0",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo0}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd0}),10),if::(1,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo0}月,${_me0}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[7].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd1}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd1},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd1}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd1},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me1",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo1}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd1}),10),if::(le::(${_dy1},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo1}月,${_me1}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[14].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd2}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd2},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd2}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd2},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me2",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo2}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd2}),10),if::(le::(${_dy2},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo2}月,${_me2}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[21].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd3}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd3},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd3}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd3},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me3",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo3}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd3}),10),if::(le::(${_dy3},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo3}月,${_me3}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd4",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[28].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd4}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd4},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd4}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd4},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me4",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo4}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd4}),10),if::(le::(${_dy4},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo4}月,${_me4}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd5",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[35].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd5}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd5},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd5}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd5},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me5",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo5}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd5}),10),if::(le::(${_dy5},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo5}月,${_me5}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd6",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[42].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy6",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd6}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd6},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo6",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd6}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd6},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me6",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo6}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk6",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd6}),10),if::(le::(${_dy6},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo6}月,${_me6}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd7",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[49].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy7",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd7}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd7},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo7",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd7}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd7},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me7",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo7}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk7",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd7}),10),if::(le::(${_dy7},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo7}月,${_me7}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd8",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[56].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy8",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd8}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd8},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo8",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd8}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd8},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me8",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo8}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk8",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd8}),10),if::(le::(${_dy8},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo8}月,${_me8}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_gd9",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${grid[63].d},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dy9",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd9}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd9},8,10),0),99)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_mo9",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd9}),10),parseNumber::(subString::(${_gd9},5,7),0),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_me9",
        "value": "$[index::(${MONE},calc::(${_mo9}-1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk9",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${_gd9}),10),if::(le::(${_dy9},7),if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${_mo9}月,${_me9}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "grid",
          "gn",
          "live",
          "startLbl",
          "endLbl",
          "daysRaw",
          "streak",
          "longest",
          "at",
          "actN",
          "mk0",
          "mk1",
          "mk2",
          "mk3",
          "mk4",
          "mk5",
          "mk6",
          "mk7",
          "mk8",
          "mk9"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
